{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_title", "source_sha256": "9e03c30b199b5ce8f73cbe5b2cca8bbdcd582a69e87faf3c1cd39651df2f799f", "ja": "律子と舞台裏", "zh": "律子与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1557cb2a8b26bfa0b3ffb2d0f0df12d71f345c55b8b25832463af7628e31fcc0", "ja": "律子との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "与律子在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1000_402cpr", "source_sha256": "c4b478452c1bdf35e605f00607300f0f912996a7ecbb46204d601e4c8adca65d", "ja": "あれ？　律子、まだ帰ってなかったのか。\nアイドルなんだから、残業はほどほどにな。", "zh": "咦？律子，你还没回去啊。\n你可是偶像，加班也要适度哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "52fb33a3f78b7c39ee8e171ed9ba7f420fb5f53169bf3f7cb4dc5143f109c213", "ja": "あ、プロデューサー？　残業って……。\nうわ、もうこんな時間！？", "zh": "啊，制作人？加班什么的……\n哇，已经这么晚了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "03bdd7d36f9186beea086b9f3fede50ce89267f4e68228f13bf2722c972c8a5e", "ja": "あはは、つい調べものに夢中になってました。\n明日のお昼、みんなと行くお店なんですけどね。", "zh": "啊哈哈，不小心查资料查得入迷了。\n是明天中午要和大家一起去的店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1003_402cpr", "source_sha256": "f7d7166cd1d2dbbf6fb53562ddb884ed25440c6d81eb9cfd1739ddc3d98c975a", "ja": "みんなって……\nもしかして、シアタープロジェクトの？", "zh": "大家是指……\n难道说，是剧场企划的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "7777e14aa5a83f2e9450a1b92a5329d53609ed197d61ad9ba591a8fca4023fd5", "ja": "はい。後輩たちには先輩から声をかけるのが、\nチームマネジメントの鉄則ですから。", "zh": "是的。由前辈主动联系后辈，是团队管理的铁则。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "170d132650c7c3a55f2b60d1045da04ee73d9cd2d575b38448e75acb5be9d1a2", "ja": "それに、奈緒が言ってたんです。関東のおだし、楽しみ\nにしてますね～って。期待には応えてあげないと！", "zh": "而且，奈绪还说过，她很期待关东风味的高汤呢～。可不能辜负她的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "bf3847e7dc1112d55c2840cf0fea6ae702e6da1f9bf62a27244e8f92a1667fae", "ja": "候補も絞れたし、あとで電話してみます。……ふふっ、\nああいう子がいるといいですよね。場が明るくなって。", "zh": "候选也筛选得差不多了，之后打个电话试试。……呵呵，有那样的孩子在真好啊，气氛都变得明亮起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "147287c439564633868c106d60a22627fb55cd8239e5f0cb3275699b3ae4fe36", "ja": "……ああ、よろしく頼む。\nというか、なんだか楽しそうだな？", "zh": "……嗯，那就拜托你了。\n话说回来，你看起来好像挺开心的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "f4ec9d047d685d8744edbf25bb02aa9119c08af08ea45b3587c0f2cd35ee65a9", "ja": "楽しいですよ～。ま、最初はどうなることかと\n思いましたけど！　……やってみるもんですね？", "zh": "很开心哦～。不过，刚开始的时候，我还真有点担心会变成什么样！……看来还是该试试看呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1009_402cpr", "source_sha256": "e6e8d52aeeaa2eba88669d7085d5a793bb877653703940a986746fa8b7c10aad", "ja": "うん。俺も勉強になった……。\nっと、まだまだ、本番はこれからだよな。", "zh": "嗯，我也学到了不少……。\n不过，真正的演出才刚要开始，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_009rit_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "3bb1b62a9a6baa3b9ceaa3ca4a390135bb2807e34273ce831b6ca4ef77634f18", "ja": "そうそう、まずはこのツアーを大成功させないと！\nお互い頑張りましょうね、チーフプロデューサー殿♪", "zh": "对对，首先得让这次巡演大获成功才行！我们一起加油吧，制作人阁下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
